<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13399] CpuLoad metric reports -1 under Java 11 in embedded mode</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13399</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When running a node in embedded mode under Java 11, the CpuLoad metric reports -1. The process needs to be started with the following option:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;--add-opens jdk.management/com.sun.management.internal=ALL-UNNAMED&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We need to get rid of this requirement to run Java with additional flags to get proper values for the CpuLoad metric.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Some investigation was done under the following issue:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13306&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13306&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
